<title>USA: Eden Prairie, Minn., $2.865 mln won by CRONIN.</title>
<headline>Eden Prairie, Minn., $2.865 mln won by CRONIN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co., Inc., said it won $2.865 million of Eden Prairie, Minn., general obligation improvement refunding bonds, Series 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 5.13 percent.</p>
